      <p class="wc-dek">De link is kapot of de pagina is verhuisd.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:20px">
        <a href="/" style="color:var(--green-900);font-weight:700">Naar home →</a>
        &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="/methode/" style="color:var(--green-900)">Methode</a>
